        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Energy inputs were derived from detailed literature studies and specifications from the manufacturer, relevant for the European production.\n\n# Included processes\nThe unit process inventory takes into account the use of energy resources, cited in Kongshaug (1998), needed for the production of calcium nitrate as by-product during the manufacture of NPK fertilisers. These values must be considered as uncertain, because the system boundaries were not clearly defined by Kongshaug. Infrastructure was included by means of a proxy module.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
